{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026UTS71qe7RI1795100338.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>灣仔利東街的聖誕燈飾正式亮起，將會舉辦多場飄雪匯演。</p><p></p><p>利東街整條大道變成巨型禮物工房，超過二百件禮物盒、雪花及星形燈飾，高高掛起。兩端入口外牆有巨型紅絲帶蝴蝶結，亦不少得堆滿禮物的聖誕樹。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.XMAS-2130_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026B4hTGYGXli1795100347.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>下月起，逢周五、六及平安夜等指定日子，會舉行共50場飄雪匯演以及北歐聖誕市集。燈飾會一直亮燈到明年1月3日。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T15:19:15.141332+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T13:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T03:57:13.948674+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T15:12:36.948271+00:00","content_hash":"eaabbc22f8e2491e3a2f12761472f3e602f8c888fdc807f3b6d22a5232b28141","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T15:19:15.141332+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}